      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can +1 this; running a 3090 and the framerate dips to low 20s as soon as a 3.0 avatar joins the room.\nI am willing to keep the VRC+ update under suspicion as there have been changes made to the rendering engine (things like Bloom and such have been moved/changed).\nI was in a room with 2 people, one of which changed into a 3.0 avatar with decent avatar stats (should be easily handled by my system) - and the framerate went from 80 to 15-20.\nSomething has been goofed up with the rendering engine as my graphics card sat at 20% usage and 20FPS. I suspect a programming bug, personally..",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
