      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Issues on my end were resolved by the last update.\nIf your GPU swap caused the FPS to dip; you may be experiencing the same issue I had.\nI went from 1070 to 3090 and there were weird hiccups in framerate and all sorts of weirdness going on. I resorted to Display Driver Uninstaller (DDU for short), to fully wipe Nvidia out of my PC and then go in with a fresh install.\nThe fresh install resolved most of the clock-speed weirdness and framerate inconsistencies on my end.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
